  ],
  "notes": [
    "Loss is the SAND the Ethereum OFTAdapterForSand released on Base-origin messages after the takeover until it was empty, at DefiLlama's SAND price (the CEX price held while the attacker dumped into a thin Uniswap pool, so rule 12 does not apply). Base DEX pools held under 17 WETH and are not added: their WETH mostly recirculated from arbitrageurs who redeemed adapter SAND.",
    "The attacker's own transactions (delegate takeovers and forged-message mints) are listed; hundreds of copycats repeated the takeover on Base and eight on the BNB Chain sibling, whose SAND pool held only dust.",
    "Recovered or reimbursed amounts do not reduce the loss."
  ],
